  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1. The conversion of the house into two one- bedroom self-contained flats is not acceptable in principle because it would result in the loss of small family house, for which there is an identified need in the borough, contrary to adopted Unitary Development Plan policy H.3.4 (Conversion of Houses to Flats) and associated supplementary guidance.\r\n\r\n2. The proposed conversion is unacceptable in that it would result in cramped and inadequate and inaccessible living accommodation, would fail to provide a family unit on the ground floor, contrary to adopted Unitary Development Plan policies ENV-B.1.1 (New Development), H.3.4 (Conversion of Houses to Flats), H.4.1 (Housing Standards and Guidelines), and associated supplementary guidance. \r\n"
